abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark framework for comparing data ingestion strategies
  (Batch, Micro-batch, and Streaming) using Apache Spark and Apache Flink.
  This project measures end-to-end latency, throughput, resource utilization,
  and fault recovery time across various load scenarios.
